-- title:
--   Counting positions above a depth threshold
-- statement:
--   For a board on a positive cycle and natural threshold $k$, count positions whose backward depth is at least $k$. The count uses every cyclic position once. In particular threshold zero counts all $n$ positions. No balance, boundedness, or lift condition is included. This quantity records crowding at a depth level for subsequent scan estimates.
